  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The application fails to comply with the terms of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class AA of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) for the following reasons:\r\nThe proposal and submitted documents fail to demonstrate how the additional storey would mitigate the impact to neighbouring properties. This would therefore result in an unacceptable loss of privacy and light to 17 Jersey Road, contrary to the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended), Schedule 2, Part 1, Class AA, Clause 3 (a) (i). Additionally, the proposed windows on the side elevations are contrary to Schedule 2, Part 1, Class AA, Clause 2 (a). "
